Package: intel-compilers-devel-ohpc
Architecture: all
Depends: ohpc-filesystem,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: OpenHPC compatibility package for Intel(R) oneAPI HPC Toolkit
 Provides OpenHPC-style compatible modulefiles for use with the Intel(R)
 oneAPI HPC Toolkit. Installs the Intel oneAPI APT repository configuration
 and module generation scripts.
 .
 This package does NOT Depends: on intel-oneapi-* packages directly because
 OBS download-on-demand only resolves binary-amd64 indexes, not binary-all.
 Instead, the postinst runs `apt-get install intel-oneapi-*` which uses APT
 natively (handling both amd64 and all architectures).
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
